  "Software Details": "Software detaljer",
  "The Consignment Module integration in Dash SaaS streamlines the creation and management of consignment agreements for businesses. Within the platform, users can easily generate customized consignment agreements tailored to their specific needs. These agreements can include detailed terms and conditions, pricing structures, commission rates, Tax calculation and inventory specifications. By providing a centralized platform for agreement creation, businesses can ensure consistency and accuracy across all their consignment partnerships, fostering stronger relationships with consignment partners and minimizing the risk of disputes.": "Consignment Module-integrationen i Dash SaaS strømliner oprettelsen og styringen af ​​forsendelsesaftaler for virksomheder. ",
  "/Month": "/Måned",
