  "Efficient ": "Effektiv ",
  " Inventory Tracking ": " Lagersporing ",
  " and Management": " og ledelse",
  "With the Consignment Module, businesses can efficiently track and manage consigned inventory within Dash SaaS. ": "Med Consignment Module kan virksomheder effektivt spore og administrere afsendt beholdning i Dash SaaS. ",
  "Viewing and Pricing Products in Consignment": "Visning og prissætning af produkter i forsendelse",
  "The Commission Module allows users to view a comprehensive list of products in consignment, ensuring complete visibility over inventory. Additionally, users can manage and update the pricing of these consigned products, which is essential for accurate commission calculations. This feature ensures that all commission-related transactions reflect the most current product prices, maintaining transparency and precision in payouts. You can also add the tax in your consignment while pricing.": "Kommissionsmodulet giver brugerne mulighed for at se en omfattende liste over produkter i sending, hvilket sikrer fuldstændig synlighed over lagerbeholdningen. ",
  "Creating and Converting Purchase Orders": "Oprettelse og konvertering af indkøbsordrer",
  "In the Commission Module, users can create detailed purchase orders and seamlessly convert these orders into actual purchases. This streamlined process ensures that procurement activities are efficiently managed and that all purchases are accurately recorded for commission calculations. By automating the conversion of purchase orders, the module reduces manual effort and enhances the accuracy of the procurement and commission tracking processes.": "I kommissionsmodulet kan brugere oprette detaljerede indkøbsordrer og problemfrit konvertere disse ordrer til faktiske indkøb. ",
  "Creating and Converting Sale Orders": "Oprettelse og konvertering af salgsordrer",
  "The Commission Module also supports the creation of sale orders, which can be easily converted into finalized sales. This functionality is crucial for tracking sales performance and ensuring that commissions are calculated based on completed transactions. By automating the sale order conversion process, the module ensures timely and precise commission payouts, aligning sales": "Kommissionsmodulet understøtter også oprettelsen af ​​salgsordrer, som nemt kan konverteres til endelige salg. ",
